{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_07_beg","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_07","title":"昇華之夜","storyCode":"LE-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c708c0b6185cda54ae2f67d6bf9a19614d9b090bb8054c33e485a5b149dc858f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生已經出去好一會兒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是為了收治中毒的感染者的問題，要去和夕照區之外的醫院交涉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，怎麼樣，那些醫院——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勉強談下來了兩家最大的，合約已經簽好，其他的......實在是不行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可羅德島和醫院簽過協定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也在啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的。羅德島和那些醫院的合約僅限礦石病本身引起的症狀，他們有充足的理由不收治因中毒而倒下的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，先生好歹談下了兩家醫院，應該足夠了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，夠了，當然夠了！我用自己手裡全部的版權做抵押，他們背後的財團當然覺得夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道您——把自己的版權轉讓給了那家財團？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不光以前的版權，連明天音樂會錄音的發行權我都賣給他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我可以從零開始了......咳、咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，先生？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生，您在出門的時候沒做任何防護措施，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說那些源石蟲散發出來的臭氣？合約能早一秒簽下來都是好的，我出門時沒考慮這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您絕對不能再像今天這樣莽撞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不能再”？也就是說，我還有一段時間好活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有我在呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，身體一垮下來，看醫生也覺得順眼多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我應該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是黑鍵，你怎麼一句話都不說？難道是覺得現在夕照區太危險，想退出了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可告訴你，到了現在這一步，音樂會我無論如何也要辦好，不要想臨陣脫逃的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要想臨陣脫逃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）他現在能受得了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）稍等一等吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來不是要退出音樂會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不是要退出音樂會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵，你一緊張就喜歡重複別人的話，我從一開始就能看得出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼話就說吧，我倒要看看，都現在這副樣子了，還有什麼事是我受不了的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳咳咳！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生，水、水！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳，格特魯德這個——這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你，你怎麼想的，居然能同意這種計畫？虧我還覺得你算是可造之才，你就想用音樂表達這種東西？一場陰謀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是這個意思——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不是？你一開始不是老老實實答應那個瘋女人了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼，我記得你說過，就算是刻骨的憎恨，只要能用合適的技法表達出來，那也是純粹的音樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說過，然後呢？你想表達什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說實話，現在我已經覺得自己當時的想法很可笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想追求的，無非是自由而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——自由，對自由的渴望，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要把它用音樂表達出來，你還差得遠呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經深刻地感受到這一點了，否則我才不來找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走？去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還能是哪，音樂廳啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前格特魯德就耍花招把我擋在音樂廳休息室外面，現在我倒要看看，她在裡面搞了什麼名堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您的身體......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與其在這裡被他和那女人氣死，我還不如去看看他們到底在搞什麼鬼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g11_lounge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵，格特魯德對休息室裡的什麼東西動了手腳，她跟你說過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用她說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能看出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這哪裡是動了一點手腳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那個音箱了嗎？很明顯有被拆過的痕跡。那邊的唱機也是，她甚至連螺絲都沒擰緊——嘖，連螺絲刀都忘記收起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是貴族，這水準粗糙得我都想笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，你把那個唱機拿過來，我看看她除了唱臂還改了什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在唱機裡面加裝拾音器？這只會引發回路間的干擾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已經把唱針拆掉了，這東西現在只是個擴音器而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個音箱也是，輸入的回路整個被拆掉了，也變成了擴音器......她在休息室裡裝這麼多擴音器幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也沒說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就試試好了，去舞台上隨便吹點什麼。想找到答案，這是最快的方法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像沒什麼異樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也聽不出什麼特別之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去告訴黑鍵，讓他稍微用一點點法術......最簡單的驅散睡意的那種，一定要控制在最弱的程度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳、咳——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心我......我只是，心跳得有點快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵，你在這，再用一下剛才的法術，記得注意音量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是外面傳來的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這不是黑鍵吹出來的笛聲嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"車爾尼張了張嘴，沒發出聲音。\n他好像已經知道答案了。\n然而，芙蓉從他臉上看見的，不是興奮，也不是憤怒，而是恐懼。\n純粹的恐懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特魯德把這間休息室，不，把整個夕照廳，改裝成了一個巨大的擴音器，兼法術放大裝置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有探測到音樂法術，擴音器會一直保持在關閉的狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可一旦有人在台上用音樂施術，放大裝置就會被啟動......法術就會被指數級地擴大，隨著音樂擴散到夕照廳外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塵世之音的洩漏和共振......也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呆滯的眼神）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，所有受到影響的區域，其中的源石活性都會急劇提升，維謝海姆的所有人，幾乎無一例外，全部會受到感染......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些已經感染了礦石病的人更不可能倖免，他們死後，遺體快速崩解，又會產生大量活性源石微粒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這周圍會變成徹頭徹尾的疫區，維謝海姆將徹底與外界斷絕聯繫——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉打擾你們聊天，不過，我是來向你們提意見的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此美妙的夜晚，為什麼要向整個維謝海姆施放令人清醒的法術呢？我可是經常失眠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我們現在正在處理很重要的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特魯德？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，車爾尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位就是羅德島的芙蓉幹員吧？幸會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於那邊那個看起來受了什麼打擊的年輕人，要不要去我家喝點什麼，美美地睡上一覺，明天再接著努力一把呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格——格特魯德，你竟然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我竟然？難道你是想說，我竟然騙了你，差點讓你成為害死半城人的兇手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真正生氣的，是我竟然把你耍得團團轉，甚至差點要了你的命，而你卻毫無察覺，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿出點貴族的氣魄啊，烏提卡伯爵。來，說點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵，你別被她挑釁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在只有一個疑問：你來到底是想幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是因為你們吵醒了我，還能是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就當成是你聽見了剛剛擴散出去的音樂法術的聲音，意識到自己的佈置已經敗露了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答正確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜啊，明明只要再拖一天，我的計畫就圓滿成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候，你最應該做的難道不是趕緊逃走嗎？難道你覺得，把我們幾個打倒，你的計畫就能進行下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵已經不會幫你了，不管你要用合奏引發什麼陰謀，都不可能再實現了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？我不這麼覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要黑鍵和白堊還在，我的計畫就沒失敗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你們解決掉，我可以繼續和烏提卡伯爵談條件。他很熟悉這種貴族之間討價還價的邏輯，回心轉意也不是不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是，我不覺得你們能贏得過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們三個都有烏提卡伯爵這種程度的實力，那我確實不能硬拼，可你們三個，呵呵......失禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你休想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏提卡伯爵，要不然，我們倆各退一步吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各退一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把這些放大器拆掉，你繼續配合我就好。這樣一來，只要死一個白堊，反正他也沒幾天好活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那真是遺憾啊，烏提卡伯爵，你迫於形勢，選擇了一條最不適合自己的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是真心的也就算了，可惜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會後悔一輩子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，看來我們只能打一架了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我贏了，自封的夕照區守衛者們就只好乖乖閉嘴，我可以繼續和烏提卡伯爵談條件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們贏了，我也沒什麼好說的，輸了就是輸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拔杖吧，烏提卡伯爵，難道你想讓兩個感染者替你打頭陣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過了，這樣的挑釁是沒用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，別礙事，我今天一定要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好好想想，這是哪裡，這裡佈置了什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你能做到一點音樂法術都不用，否則搞不好瘟疫還沒來，你先把維謝海姆的居民都變成了瘋子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖嘖，腦子很快啊，芙蓉小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，既然被你識破了，那我們去外面決一勝負吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事先提醒一下，可不要以為逃走就算是勝利了。我個人是不想對無關人士動粗的，但我的手下可未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶這麼多人過來，看來你對自己沒什麼信心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於聽見了熟悉的冷嘲熱諷，我都要感動哭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你好些了，烏提卡伯爵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，斯特羅洛女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出去吧，讓我們痛痛快快地打一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在烏提卡沒人陪你玩打架遊戲，一定很寂寞吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有其他對手，我也不想和你這樣的阿姨玩啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟你連爵位都沒爭過自己的親哥哥，還要等他死掉再上位，我猜你和他打架一定沒贏過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，很好，我越來越討厭你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼此彼此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
